! Pahadi.scl
!
Pahadi in B - Nadi (just intonation). Kashmiri folk; lyrical major pentatonic with Ma and komal Ni as common variants.
!
 7
!
 9/8
 5/4
 4/3
 3/2
 5/3
 9/5
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   Re    203.91 cents
!   Ga    386.31 cents
!   Ma    498.04 cents
!   Pa    701.96 cents
!   Dha   884.36 cents
!   ni   1017.60 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
! Sattvagenic - sattvagenic.com/nadi
! Intended root: B3 = 493.8833 Hz — set your synth's base/root note to B.
